    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Jan 2024 04:23:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><em><strong><span>Say Hi!朋友们！</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>2024我想告诉我亲爱的朋友们：</span><strong><span>我们可以给自己多点时间，给世界多点耐心~</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>如果你准备好了</span><u><strong><span>耐心</span></strong></u><span>，就让我们一起来听听风车车给大家带来亲身</span><u><strong><span>从觉得一切生活毫无意义、无动力和死亡拖延</span></strong></u><span>——</span><u><em><strong><span>转变成能量满满，每日超长待机15小时兴奋状态！（我到底是怎么从P的状态变成J人的？？？）</span></strong></em></u></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>Time list</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">00:27</a> 坏运气留在2023</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="163">02:43</a> 2024一月高能量的“打工人”该有的状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="319">05:19</a> 去了一趟大理我反而变得更</span><strong><span>“糟”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="581">09:41</a> 重启人生我无意识做对了哪些事情？</span><u><em><strong><span>（保留P人的”好运“，学习J人”思维“ ）</span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><u><em><span>好运心理暗示：对着烟花、日出、鲜花许愿！</span></em></u><u><em><strong><span>（P人保留项目）</span></strong></em></u></li><span>  </span><li><u><em><span>立刻行动！</span></em></u><u><em><strong><span>（J人化）</span></strong></em></u></li><span>  </span><li><u><em><span>保持专注力</span></em></u><u><em><strong><span>！（艾维利时间管理法 J人化）</span></strong></em></u></li><span>  </span><li><u><em><span>每日感恩日记</span></em></u><u><em><strong><span>（J人化）</span></strong></em></u></li><span>  </span><li><u><em><span>每日反思记录</span></em></u><u><em><strong><span>（J人化）</span></strong></em></u></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>Wechat</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>zhendahong99</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span>添加进入”2024重启人生“群</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>Music</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>《Control》——Zoe Wees</span></em></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
