  <item>
    <title>020 允许万物穿过我的身体</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6549fd31287a0d9f13520e90</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6549fd31287a0d9f13520e90</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Nov 2023 09:02:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><em><strong><span>Say hi！</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span>Hello，大家好！欢迎新老朋友们收听《狂人漫步》！</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>首先，恭喜《狂人漫步》栏目诞生一年内粉丝达到1000了，这对于我以及一起成长的你们来说都是有小小的意义的，未来无论遇到什么挫折和惊喜，风车车都会一直陪伴大家！</span></em></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span>本期主题是“允许万物穿过我的身体”，朋友，你经历过最难熬的日子吗？如果有机会选择回到过去，你还会选择一定要经历这个挫折吗？如果你的答案是肯定的！请点击本期节目，让我们一起从那一个个奔溃的瞬间，拼凑出更具魅力更强大的模样，让一切所发生的事物穿过我们的身体和心灵，以另一种方式从我们的身体流淌出去！</span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>List</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:22</a> 秋天，闭上眼让阳光穿过你身体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>离谱一：把👮‍阿Sir当诈骗犯给拉黑了！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a></span><strong><span> &nbsp;离谱二：我在学校被阿Sir🚓带走了！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a> &nbsp;被关进审讯室！&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1548">25:48</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>能拯救你自己的，只有你自己。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1668">27:48</a> 遇事——</span><strong><span>不要让情绪去控制你的大脑，冷静！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1695">28:15</a> &nbsp;平时多熟悉</span><strong><span>法条</span></strong><span>——关键时候救命符</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1761">29:21</a> 离谱三：硕士论文开题答辩——</span><strong><span>挂了！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2147">35:47</a> </span><strong><span>不要压抑逃避自己的情绪，你的世界只有你自己</span></strong><span>！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2298">38:18</a> 不要妄想改变不公平，</span><strong><span>让自己变成定义公平的人 ！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2371">39:31</a> </span><u><strong><span>反思指南：</span></strong></u><u><strong><span>悲伤发生当下如何缓解情绪的蔓延？</span></strong></u></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2495">41:35</a> </span><u><em><strong><span>自救指南：发生一周后，如何拼凑破碎的自己？如何补给能量，重新出发？ &nbsp;</span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>Music</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span>Simon's Song (from the Netflix Series Young Royals)</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>Email</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span>2585354488@qq.com</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>Wechat</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span>zhendahong99</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>Ending</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span>Let everything pass through me and allow all things to happen!</span></strong></em></u></p>]]></description>
