  <item>
    <title>018 $在内卷的时代如何提高个人的灵活度？——提高个人储蓄率</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64f3390f80c9ec4c5ffa9a17</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64f3390f80c9ec4c5ffa9a17</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 02 Sep 2023 13:30:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><strong><span>简介</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>你是否属于认为自己是</span><strong><span>存不下钱的人</span></strong><span>或者认为</span><strong><span>自己不需要存钱</span></strong><span>，如果你属于这两种，那么这一期将是</span><strong><span>劝说大家存钱￥￥￥！</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>你是否思考过疫情冲击下失业率急剧增加，大厂裁员，是什么导致我们失去</span><strong><span>安全感</span></strong><span>？你觉得</span><strong><span>金钱对于你意味</span></strong><span>着什么？年轻人月光，在大城市工作五年没有一点积蓄，难道父母一辈的</span><strong><span>储蓄观念</span></strong><span>真的过时了吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>你思考过个人财富的积累的</span><strong><span>影响因素</span></strong><span>嘛？你知道</span><strong><span>财富积累与收入和投资回报率、储蓄率的关系吗</span></strong><span>？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>当你的</span><strong><span>收入提升</span></strong><span>的时候，你将如何从心理学角度思考来提高你的财富？如果你有以上的疑惑希望这期的内容能给你该来新的视角！</span><u><span>如果因为这期节目你有存钱的念头，一定在评论区跟风车车一起记录命运的齿轮转动的一刻。</span></u></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>内容导览</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">00:01:46</a>:财富积累与</span><strong><span>收入</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>投资回报率</span></strong><span>关系不大，而与</span><u><strong><span>储蓄率</span></strong></u><span>关系很大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="282">00:04:42</a>:财富的积累与</span><strong><span>个人需求</span></strong><span>的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="499">00:08:19</a>:你的物质需求由</span><strong><span>欲望</span></strong><span>决定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="771">00:12:51</a>:储蓄的真正意义——</span><strong><span>时间的自由</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>联系方式</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>2585354488@qq.com</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
