    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><strong><span>认识偏差一：追求财富而不是金钱</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a> 财富和金钱的区别是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>财富：是指可以在你睡觉的时候帮你赚钱的东西</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>金钱：转移财富的工具，具有支配别人时间的特征</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>认知偏差二：靠出租时间是不可以致富的</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="374">06:14</a> 如何拥有</span><strong><span>股权</span></strong><span>？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="469">07:49</a> 创立公司的</span><strong><span>核心</span></strong><span>是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>“创造有需求但是没有被满足的产品。”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="837">13:57</a> 作为</span><strong><span>普通人</span></strong><span>不创业如何获得股权？选择</span><strong><span>哪个行业</span></strong><span>打工？</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>书籍</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>《纳瓦尔宝典》</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>商务合作</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>2585354488@qq.com</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>团队</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>风车车</span></p>]]></description>
